<title>USA: Deere &amp; Co unit sells $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Deere &amp; Co unit sells $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from John Deere Capital, a unit of Deere &amp; Co was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER JOHN DEERE CAPITAL</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	   COUPON 6.30 PCT  MATURITY 6/01/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	     ISS PRICE 99.942 FIRST PAY DATE 12/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2	YIELD 6.33 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P A-PLUS	     SPREAD 20 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
